-rid="ea21af82-6671-4653-95df-a01cb47d12a4" class="r-1fh1kh2"><picture data-rid="4974606b-d83f-4052-b789-43306b295e0b" class="r-1w0pq6y"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/3cb22fa2-92b4-431d-9c77-ab8f43437e16?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/3cb22fa2-92b4-431d-9c77-ab8f43437e16?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/3cb22fa2-92b4-431d-9c77-ab8f43437e16?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/3cb22fa2-92b4-431d-9c77-ab8f43437e16" class="r-x6y8k6" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="e6f15915-5205-4351-a5c3-eca955726aab" class="r-16370k3"><div data-rid="65794cb7-2386-4966-8a0a-54a0e415de35" class="r-ukgq68 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p></span></div><div data-rid="55a0a93f-2200-406a-9910-e4ee8bfb46c0" class="r-15pqqdq" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="26f6ab40-8a87-4754-bae8-e86a6e34cbb2" class="r-uoo10d" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e1046d09-f1c7-4f14-8370-02c24f08e2c7" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:R6n32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1i50055 r-1ieq5ja"><div data-rid="46718048-3ae8-4101-83df-81bbd0a03d80" class="r-5i5013 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What ages is the Academy designed for?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a4d99554-0c85-49f7-8fa9-0aba5a37dfe8" class="r-xu7k2x" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-14dcvr" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h7a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-7A.5.5 0 0 1 4 8"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R6n32:"><div data-rid="c219937e-7dd1-4840-b5c4-859971add031" class="r-1f722hd"><div data-rid="d99e5564-e4ed-442c-a37f-9e6f10130213" class="r-9x7s8s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Tuttle Twins Academy is specifically designed for ages 12-18. The content uses engaging storytelling and real-world examples that resonate with teens while teaching complex economic and civic concepts. Younger students (ages 5-11) should start with our illustrated book series, which we can recommend based on your child's reading level.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d6c82222-52fd-458e-80cd-76a5393a748e" class="r-1k3eqqa" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="df88c826-44fc-4b80-a2ee-777f1568fdb8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Ran32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-xgi8c4"><div data-rid="a614aadc-e89d-43c9-ab9c-abe0e0a754ec" class="r-1dp2igj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is this too political or biased?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a3cc42e8-2263-4290-9a2d-10ff48caf20b" class="r-n1ckwy" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-fct4fi" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Ran32:"><div data-rid="3edccfdb-cb86-419d-9547-7a96c9fd4913" class="r-dlhvf2"><div data-rid="2db942f3-cfe7-4cca-8358-560cb9642e1e" class="r-15lz017 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We're transparent: we teach principles of liberty, free markets, and personal responsibility from a libertarian/classical liberal perspective. However, we focus on developing critical thinking skills—teaching students to question ALL authority (including us!) and form their own reasoned conclusions. We're not telling kids what to think; we're giving them tools to think for themselves. Many families appreciate that we don't pretend to be "neutral" while actually promoting other viewpoints.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0489aee5-f474-4a14-b52e-28511aa6e54a" class="r-1nph54a" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b9b1ec1a-a206-451c-863e-c54c40118ce6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Ren32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-10gmgxh"><div data-rid="a7bb35a7-f14f-48b9-a348-4e644a3f5457" class="r-1gq1p0o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How does this work with homeschooling?</p></span></div><div data-rid="233e3ebc-9b1d-4b11-a97b-f337b2980648" class="r-lng4fz" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1giyla8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Ren32:"><div data-rid="3c9bb207-0710-4efb-b6c0-8fc0ad316125" class="r-16auq4t"><div data-rid="9bca4ab1-d978-4091-a971-be715f78f690" class="r-108qhbs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Academy works perfectly as a social studies/civics/economics curriculum component for homeschoolers. Lessons are self-paced, include discussion questions and activities, and cover topics many homeschool curricula skip. Many families use it for ages 12+ while using our illustrated books for younger children (ages 5-11).</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2751d457-a390-457f-816a-c85766a2c262" class="r-1fbeqxw" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c365cf09-f625-4438-a3f2-f19b58e4e2d5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rin32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1sx7zyl"><div data-rid="ecf92e15-02b0-47c3-b081-82b9fa7c3b52" class="r-h4sq9c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can my teen in public/private school still benefit?</p></span></div><div data-rid="fec30279-307c-416a-9b37-d93b4b11e950" class="r-1xgguwu" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-17zwpv" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rin32:"><div data-rid="d3d7f6cb-ec25-4271-b37d-29ec6f4c9760" class="r-10w29uc"><div data-rid="a8ce8014-1321-4165-8bc3-03c58e281eb5" class="r-15zhouz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely! Many families use the Academy to supplement traditional schooling, providing perspectives and topics their teens aren't getting elsewhere. It's perfect for after-school learning and creates great opportunities for family discussions about current events and real-world applications.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6fdf739a-f589-447d-8646-13b2252d477a" class="r-1ai4h3e" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="587bdf1d-4b71-4533-8d44-8b6ff5e85012" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rmn32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-utd4lx"><div data-rid="dd04cdf4-0301-4b81-9669-fc24677379eb" class="r-r3d2jc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What if my teen doesn't engage with it?</p></span></div><div data-rid="0579026b-19de-423e-847a-8a1e58a3b744" class="r-nrdocn" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-gatkry" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rmn32:"><div data-rid="6e028aa6-0802-4753-9fd3-33d3f65ac579" class="r-pyizf7"><div data-rid="01099cbc-1c05-4d41-a634-eace192af2f8" class="r-d9fup2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee, no questions asked. That said, our story-based approach achieves 93% retention rates (vs. 13% for traditional textbooks), and most families report their teens actively asking for more lessons. We also offer a free first lesson so you can try before committing.</span></p><br><p><span>Try your first FREE Lesson </span><a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://tuttletwinsacademy.com/courses/how-system-really-works/"><u>HERE</u></a></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d1a75405-6112-4cd3-bb20-b201b5c42f84" class="r-oetkh5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="8f33e200-b859-4b01-9d03-2cf5582502ef" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rqn32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-hbzoob"><div data-rid="ce953b27-9d67-4c02-9779-62cccfe5cdbf" class="r-acnv4s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How is lifetime access different from annual?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d7037a82-06c5-4d88-b488-6247f44a7f7d" class="r-7fjcup" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-12gkbms" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rqn32:"><div data-rid="2c8d6c4f-6317-4b17-97ac-9eed10516007" class="r-10wgqmz"><div data-rid="5435c107-e0ee-425f-8112-00dd86c462d6" class="r-tm3n3i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Lifetime access is a one-time payment of $559 that gives you unlimited access forever to all current AND future courses we create. Annual access is $299/year and renews each year. If you plan to use the Academy for more than 2 years or have multiple teens, lifetime is the better value. Plus, all future courses we add are included free with lifetime access.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c81b54f5-fec8-4760-814a-7e7105860724" class="r-rik7ed"><div class="r-k32zfc" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="bc0597f4-7084-418c-9741-0fb3bec355f7" class="r-1a4vuf"><div data-rid="f1fb77f1-57b6-4583-8a21-bb9f943bcc58" class="r-1gm6aht"><div data-rid="8b2650c8-a406-4dae-914d-159ffc989520" class="r-ot239a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Give Your Teen an Education Most Adults Never Got</p></span></div><div data-rid="d22ee851-c70f-4407-997c-ca091251482f" class="r-12rgpq1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Start your first lesson completely free. No credit card required.</p></span></div><div data-rid="938213a7-b41c-4f1c-9bdc-60c9cda5caa7" class="r-vpk8qb"><button data-rid="aabc0952-fff7-4f47-804e-31aa414d6f94" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-1o1eob6 alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="d4ee222a-3c80-49e3-be48-f69a2705b858" class="r-dfb723 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Enroll In The Academy</p></span></div></button></div></div><div data-rid="18f43cad-76a7-4cbf-b0ab-c2b3c4f32226" class="r-lko8uw"><picture data-rid="096f3e6b-918a-4c08-bf57-db5e6aad77f0" class="r-1w8n68s"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720